Assumption 5.1 
The matrix {{formula:2d93f833-8073-47e8-a7d1-37b2df5821f5}}  in (REF ) is Schur stable, i.e., the absolute value of the eigenvalues of {{formula:4be6767a-ab3e-40dd-9fbb-7abee5949344}}  are all strictly less than 1.{{formula:da61ce76-14c7-4f62-8b8d-318d7048bc01}}

