Values of {{formula:71fb326b-18c2-48e8-86de-3eb76d93b266}}  are plotted in the {{formula:6989098f-8b26-4209-956f-79ac0623d525}}  plane in Fig. REF  for a disc of total mass {{formula:7e5e0620-35d6-4f76-9cba-f5b5f7193874}}  extending from {{formula:a04abefd-ac62-4126-9dfb-c0fa74db246d}}  AU to {{formula:62565de3-f93a-4f29-adee-bf705cfb5bce}}  AU, with grains of intrinsic density {{formula:bfbb8f27-324e-4816-bcf5-fea4fb0b65a7}}  kg m{{formula:3ee1ad9a-2a55-4544-8032-99e347da01a3}}  and {{formula:60240928-f911-49b3-8ff6-5dad7354bcac}} , for both {{formula:6ad31998-d68b-4441-ac99-1bbce25b51c1}}  and {{formula:c7a0adc6-5f3d-4167-9204-3d22c1ce7615}} .
